{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24376","headline":"感事 · 白居易","name":"感事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"服气崔常侍，烧丹郑舍人。\n常期生羽翼，那忽化灰尘。\n每遇凄凉事，还思潦倒身。\n唯知趂杯酒，不解链金银。\n睡适三尸性，慵安五藏神。\n无忧亦无喜，六十六年春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}